[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" format=3]

; Wet stone under still water (the fountain basin of Ascent 1): the limestone of set A, dark and
; smooth, so the water above it shows the sky's reflection. Albedo about sRGB (62, 57, 52),
; roughness about 0.23. Every set shares it.

